{"id":"624513","name":"面条菜木耳拌羊肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624513/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面条菜","amount":"1把"},{"name":"羊肉","amount":"100块"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"几朵"}],"sub":[{"name":"无","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳泡发，煮一下。","img":"images/624513/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"撕成小块，放盘子里。","img":"images/624513/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面条菜洗净。","img":"images/624513/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"掰成小段。","img":"images/624513/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧水。","img":"images/624513/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"水开放面条菜煮开锅。","img":"images/624513/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"过冷水。","img":"images/624513/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"羊肉骨。","img":"images/624513/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/624513/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把肉弄成小块，和面条菜一起放盘子里。","img":"images/624513/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"碗里放食盐和腊八蒜腊八醋。","img":"images/624513/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搅拌至食盐溶化，浇在菜品上即可。","img":"images/624513/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624513/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624513/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}